@startuml C1_VVE_Update_Logical
title C1 – VVE Update (Logical Relationships)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  BorderColor Black
}

rectangle "Logistics Operator" as Operator
rectangle "VveDetailsComponent" as Ui
rectangle "TodoApi VveController" as Proxy
rectangle "OEM Vve API" as OemApi
rectangle "Vve Repository" as VveRepo
rectangle "Vvn Repository" as VvnRepo
rectangle "Audit Log" as Audit
rectangle "IAM" as Iam

Operator --> Ui : Submit updated berth/dock
Ui --> Proxy : PATCH /vves/{vveId}
Proxy --> Iam : Validate token
Proxy --> OemApi : Forward request
OemApi --> VveRepo : Update VVE record
OemApi --> VvnRepo : Fetch planned dock (compare)
OemApi --> Audit : Append update entry
VveRepo --> OemApi : Updated VVE
OemApi --> Proxy : VVE response + warnings
Proxy --> Ui : JSON DTO
Ui --> Operator : Confirmation & warning note

@enduml
